    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics"},
      "description": "Requested GPUs divided by allocatable GPUs. Best-fit reaches 100% because the later 4-GPU Pod can start immediately; the current-utilization scorer leaves it Pending until space is released.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 12, "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter", "lineWidth": 3, "pointSize": 5, "showPoints": "always", "spanNulls": false}, "max": 100, "min": 0, "unit": "percent"},
        "overrides": [
          {"matcher": {"id": "byRegexp", "options": "/.*best-fit.*/"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed"}}]},
          {"matcher": {"id": "byRegexp", "options": "/.*utilization.*/"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed"}}]}
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "id": 1,
      "options": {"legend": {"calcs": ["max", "mean"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [{"datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics"}, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "gpu_allocation_percent{scope=\"cluster\",evaluation_id=~\"$evaluation\",scenario_id=~\"scenario-gpu-.*-binpack\"}", "legendFormat": "{{scenario_id}}", "range": true, "refId": "A"}],
      "title": "Cluster GPU allocation",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics"},
      "description": "The best-fit score preserves the 4-GPU slot on gpu-large by placing the 1-GPU filler on gpu-small.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 0},
      "id": 2,
      "options": {"content": "## Expected decision\n\n`seed-4gpu` → **gpu-large** in both runs\n\nCurrent utilization: `filler-1gpu` → **gpu-large**\n\nBest-fit: `filler-1gpu` → **gpu-small**\n\nResult: `workload-4gpu` waits only in the current-utilization run.\n\n> This dashboard reports GPU **requests allocated by the scheduler**, not physical device activity measured by DCGM.", "mode": "markdown"},
      "title": "How to read the demo",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics"},
